CHAPTER.VERS:
And say to the Ammonites, Hear the word of the Lord 
        GOD; Thus saith the Lord 
        GOD; Because thou saidst, Aha, against my sanctuary, when it was profaned; and against the land of Israel, when it was desolate; and against the house of Judah, when they went into captivity;

Thus saith the Lord 
        GOD; Because that Moab and Seir do say, Behold, the house of Judah 
         like all the heathen;
